  "name": "Bright Flames raises Inferno Barrier's retaliation damage (#1764)",
  "contract": "#1764: Bright Flames 300759 (rank 1) and 301351 (rank 2): effect 2 is ADD_PCT_MODIFIER (aura 108) on SPELLMOD_DAMAGE (misc 0), base 14 -> +15% and 29 -> +30%, class mask {0, 0, 0x400} = Inferno Barrier (504380, 535650, 535651, 582762-582764; SpellFamilyFlags {0, 0, 1024}); tooltip: increases the damage it deals by $s2% (Spell.dbc served file). The module turns the barrier's PROC_TRIGGER_DAMAGE into a dummy and deals the retaliation itself as Lucifron's Rage 524623 (family 30, empty flags) with an amount computed from effect 2 and Spirit, so the SPELLMOD_DAMAGE modifier matched neither 524623 nor that amount. The fix runs the caster's SPELLMOD_DAMAGE modifiers for the barrier rank on the amount. A second Pyromancer (Orc, PvP flagged) hits the barriered Pyromancer with Flare Bolt 800790; the barrier retaliates with one Lucifron's Rage. The damage total of 524623 is measured with no talent (control), with rank 1 and with rank 2, and compared as ratios (1.15 and 1.30 expected, truncation of the integer amount allows the wide bounds, a resolved amount of at least 4 keeps rank 2 above 1.15). Ratios need no assumption on Spirit. Fails before the fix (ratio 1.00). Not covered: the absorb half (aura 317) which already worked.",
